  "MESSAGE=create dir /nix: succeeded PRIORITY=6 SYSLOG_IDENTIFIER=mix-daemon MIX_USER=alice MIX_COMMAND=bootstrap MIX_REQUEST=request MIX_STATUS=succeeded MIX_OPERATION=create dir MIX_SUBJECT=/nix MIX_STEP=create-nix-dir",
